      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i got this really painful red lump on my arm. it's getting kinda bigger and feels warm when i touch it. honestly i'm super broke right now so i can't really do a doctor visit. do u think i can just pop it myself with a needle or something? i have rubbing alcohol so i can clean it up first",
